<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Dunlop posts higher Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Dunlop posts higher Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result for Nigerian</p>
<p>tyre maker Dunlop to end-March 1997.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>			     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Turnover		   923.2	   908.2</p>
<p> Profit after taxation  118.8	   100.9</p>
<p> Taxation		    35.6	    30.2</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   83.2	    70.6</p>
<p>($1=84.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
